type: software
title: "CKAN-Zenodo-Exporter"
abstract: >-
  Web application that publishes datasets from CKAN data portals directly to
  Zenodo, with single-resource or full-dataset export, Keycloak SSO,
  asynchronous RabbitMQ transfers with retry, and live status tracking.
